{"schemaVersion":1,"id":"reference:3df82f7495792119","name":"Level Benefits","source":{"id":"source:reference-3df82f7495792119","title":"Level Benefits","revision":26144,"timestamp":"2025-02-07T04:06:56Z","sha256":"99b745b16b98626e3d2d42661c0d20c5c6bf802f6ee5e694d16c7fb55b2bf259","url":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?oldid=26144","history":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?title=Level%20Benefits&action=history"},"article":{"sourceId":"source:reference-3df82f7495792119","blocks":[{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Reference Book: ",{"tag":"a","children":["Core Rulebook"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Core_Rulebook"}]},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["The ",{"tag":"i","children":["Star Wars Roleplaying Game "]},"uses the terms ",{"tag":"i","children":["Class Level"]}," and ",{"tag":"i","children":["Heroic Level"]}," to mean different things. Class Level pertains to a character's level in a particular Class. Heroic Level pertains to a hero's total experience (but not including the ",{"tag":"a","children":["Beast"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Beast","referenceId":"reference:628bf77a740094a9"}," and ",{"tag":"a","children":["Nonheroic"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Nonheroic","referenceId":"reference:1bca2ef1d9ebe1c3"}," classes as they are not intended for heroes). So, a character who has only one Class has a Heroic Level and Class Level that are the same. (A 7th-level ",{"tag":"a","children":["Jedi"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Jedi","referenceId":"reference:0b0e48747027a29d"}," has a Heroic Level of 7th and a Class Level of 7th.) But for a character with more than one ",{"tag":"a","children":["Heroic Class"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Heroic_Class"},", Class Level and Heroic Level are different.\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["A 4th-level ",{"tag":"a","children":["Scout"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Scout","referenceId":"reference:8a1db462be753774"},"/3rd-level ",{"tag":"a","children":["Scoundrel"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Scoundrel","referenceId":"reference:316d580fd4c35ecc"}," has a Heroic Level of 7th, with a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Scout"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Scout","referenceId":"reference:8a1db462be753774"}," Class Level of 4 and a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Scoundrel"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Scoundrel","referenceId":"reference:316d580fd4c35ecc"}," Class Level of 3. If a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Talent"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Talent"}," refers to your Class Level, but does not specify a Class, it means the combined number of levels in all ",{"tag":"a","children":["Heroic Classes"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Heroic_Classes","referenceId":"reference:3db50eedfbef40fc"}," that grant access to that ",{"tag":"a","children":["Talent"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Talent"},".\n"]},"\n\n",{"tag":"h2","children":["Class Level Benefits"]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":["Heroes gain certain benefits from their individual ",{"tag":"a","children":["Heroic Class"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Heroic_Class"},". Each of these Class Level Benefits progress independently of each other (so a character with Class Levels in multiple Heroic Classes would benefit from the sum of both Class Level Benefits).\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"h3","children":["Base Attack Bonus"]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":["Your character's Base Attack Bonus applies to all attack rolls. Use the bonus that corresponds to your character's Class Level. If a character has more than one Class, add the Base Attack Bonus for each Class together to determine the character's Base Attack Bonus. ",{"tag":"a","children":["Jedi"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Jedi","referenceId":"reference:0b0e48747027a29d"}," and ",{"tag":"a","children":["Soldiers"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Soldiers"}," have a Base Attack Bonus equal to their Class Level, while ",{"tag":"a","children":["Nobles"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Nobles"},", ",{"tag":"a","children":["Scoundrels"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Scoundrels"},", and ",{"tag":"a","children":["Scouts"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Scouts"}," have a Base Attack Bonus equal to their 3/4 their Class Level (rounded down). \n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["For example a 7th-level ",{"tag":"a","children":["Jedi"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Jedi","referenceId":"reference:0b0e48747027a29d"}," has a Base Attack Bonus of +7 while a 4th-level ",{"tag":"a","children":["Scout"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Scout","referenceId":"reference:8a1db462be753774"},"/3rd-level ",{"tag":"a","children":["Scoundrel"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Scoundrel","referenceId":"reference:316d580fd4c35ecc"}," has a Base Attack Bonus of +5 (+3 Base Attack Bonus for the ",{"tag":"a","children":["Scout"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Scout","referenceId":"reference:8a1db462be753774"}," Class Level, and +2 for the ",{"tag":"a","children":["Scoundrel"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Scoundrel","referenceId":"reference:316d580fd4c35ecc"}," Class Level).\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"table","children":["\n",{"tag":"caption","children":["\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"tbody","children":[{"tag":"tr","children":["\n",{"tag":"th","children":["HEROIC CLASS\n"],"rowspan":2},"\n",{"tag":"th","children":["BASE ATTACK BONUS BY CLASS LEVEL\n"],"colspan":20}]},"\n",{"tag":"tr","children":["\n",{"tag":"th","children":["1\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"th","children":["2\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"th","children":["3\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"th","children":["4\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"th","children":["5\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"th","children":["6\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"th","children":["7\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"th","children":["8\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"th","children":["9\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"th","children":["10\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"th","children":["11\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"th","children":["12\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"th","children":["13\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"th","children":["14\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"th